    "Seeded into an ephemeral audit DB by `ibx kernel replay --ci --seed-file <this file>`;",
    "a policy/guard change that alters any decision fails the gate with exit 2.",
    "After an INTENDED policy change run `ibx kernel replay --update-golden <this file>` and commit the diff.",
    "Envelopes are frozen (stable nonce/intentHash); only decisions are regenerated.",
